; Boss-only loot table — every entry is a guaranteed drop. The Corrupted
; Compiler is the floor 5 finale; clearing it should hand the player a
; meaningful build payoff (one legendary core, two modules, a protocol,
; and a chip) instead of the random ~50% sub-table that regular enemies
; roll. Five guaranteed drops.

